cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "implicit-geometry-kernel: signed-distance geometry for blade and wing sections"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hughes
    given-names: Sam
version: 0.9.4
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/samhughes-fea/implicit-geometry-kernel"
url: "https://samhughes-fea.github.io/implicit-geometry-kernel/"
abstract: >-
  Geometry of blade and wing cross-sections and their span lofts: aerofoils,
  planform, a layout catalogue of skins, spar caps and shear webs, spanwise
  members, and a conforming shell mesh. Signed distance fields and constructive
  solid geometry, with no materials, loads or solvers.
keywords:
  - wind turbine blade
  - tidal turbine blade
  - cross-section
  - signed distance function
  - CSG
  - shell mesh
